WEBVTT

00:12.210 --> 00:14.630
Yep. That's the image I'll go for.

00:23.610 --> 00:27.070
Hey, I wonder what the new teacher's gonna be like!

00:27.070 --> 00:29.010
I can't wait!

00:29.010 --> 00:30.710
I hope he's cute!

00:30.710 --> 00:35.010
He'd better not show up looking dorky in the same color suit and tie.

00:39.930 --> 00:41.020
Here we go!

00:41.890 --> 00:43.020
Hey everybody! Nice to...

00:44.350 --> 00:44.850
meet...

00:46.190 --> 00:46.690
you...

00:50.410 --> 00:52.690
B-Bye now!

00:53.430 --> 00:57.200
Was that... our new teacher?

00:57.200 --> 01:00.050
Yep, looks like.

01:01.960 --> 01:04.960
ＴＥＸＴ ＩＮＰＵＴ

01:03.660 --> 01:04.960
The new guy just came! :D

01:18.740 --> 01:21.070
It's so mortifying, don't you think?

01:21.070 --> 01:24.340
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing?

01:24.520 --> 01:24.560
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

01:28.690 --> 01:31.310
"You better keep your promises!"

01:31.310 --> 01:33.560
Look who's talking!

01:35.340 --> 01:37.430
Live by what you preach.

01:38.520 --> 01:41.420
All those misplaced sympathies,

01:41.420 --> 01:43.950
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

01:43.950 --> 01:46.600
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

01:46.600 --> 01:48.660
I can smell the lie from here.

01:48.660 --> 01:51.500
When I hear your true desires,

01:51.500 --> 01:54.070
I dunno what I'll do from there.

01:54.070 --> 01:55.260
Should we do it?

01:55.260 --> 01:59.390
That's for me to decide.

01:59.390 --> 02:03.650
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

02:03.650 --> 02:09.100
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

02:09.430 --> 02:13.750
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

02:13.750 --> 02:18.370
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

02:18.870 --> 02:23.450
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

02:23.890 --> 02:26.350
That I'll be.

02:26.350 --> 02:28.940
That's true.

02:28.940 --> 02:30.970
Naturally.

02:34.990 --> 02:40.000
A FRIENDLY STEP

02:34.990 --> 02:40.000
1st Period

02:38.110 --> 02:41.170
To think that the last period was gym class.

02:41.170 --> 02:42.930
No way! He peeped on you guys?!

02:42.930 --> 02:45.010
Yeah, yeah! We didn't stand a chance!

02:45.010 --> 02:47.450
If they investigate him a little, then we'll know his story.

02:47.450 --> 02:51.020
Dammit, like you all had anything to hide!

02:51.020 --> 02:51.060
Aoki

02:51.020 --> 02:51.060
Daisuke

02:52.090 --> 02:57.900
Uh, from this day forward, I will be Class One's homeroom teacher, Aoki Daisuke.

02:58.230 --> 03:00.280
Everyone, I look forward to knowing you!

03:00.280 --> 03:02.730
Nice to meet you!

03:05.990 --> 03:08.870
Well, they're more behaved than I thought.

03:10.110 --> 03:15.430
First up, in order to put your names and faces together, I'm going to take roll.

03:16.190 --> 03:17.250
Aida Itsuo!

03:17.250 --> 03:18.300
Here!

03:18.710 --> 03:20.070
Izuka Shinji!

03:20.070 --> 03:21.270
Here.

03:21.270 --> 03:22.610
Usa Mimi!

03:22.610 --> 03:23.800
She didn't come!

03:23.800 --> 03:25.250
Really?

03:26.810 --> 03:28.810
Kojima Takaya

03:30.370 --> 03:33.050
Eh... Kagami Kuro!

03:33.050 --> 03:34.470
Here~

03:35.910 --> 03:39.410
Kagami, during class time cellphones are...

03:43.330 --> 03:49.450
I-I guess I'll let it slide this time. Making waves this early might be too much to handle.

03:50.150 --> 03:52.690
Next up, Kokonoe Rin!

03:52.690 --> 03:55.750
Here, here! Heeere!

03:55.750 --> 03:58.340
Say, how old are you, Aoki-sensei?

03:58.340 --> 04:01.630
Uh, um... 23.

04:01.630 --> 04:03.150
Do you have a girlfriend?

04:03.150 --> 04:06.150
Hold... I'm taking roll right now!

04:06.150 --> 04:08.220
Ohh! You don't have one!

04:10.610 --> 04:14.430
All right, I'll be your girlfriend from now on!

04:15.930 --> 04:16.440
Huh?!

04:16.440 --> 04:20.940
Be-sides, you <i>already saw me naked!</i>

04:22.210 --> 04:24.700
Sensei's a perv!

04:23.470 --> 04:24.700
No, that's n-

04:27.090 --> 04:29.490
You there! No pictures!

04:30.210 --> 04:31.580
But it's a video.

04:31.580 --> 04:33.890
No videos either!

04:34.830 --> 04:35.540
You guys-

04:35.540 --> 04:37.080
Everyone be quiet!

04:40.590 --> 04:45.840
What on earth are you doing, Aoki-sensei?  We can hear you all the way upstairs!

04:45.840 --> 04:47.890
Y-You have my most humble apologies!

04:51.630 --> 04:53.150
STAFF OFFICE

04:57.410 --> 04:59.130
You've been working hard.

05:01.090 --> 05:03.230
Thank you very much...

05:03.230 --> 05:04.670
Um...

05:05.410 --> 05:06.660
Houin-sensei!

05:07.090 --> 05:11.870
There wasn't much you can do. The kids from Class One are pretty rowdy.

05:11.870 --> 05:13.270
Yeah...

05:14.690 --> 05:18.040
Running a class as a newly-minted teacher is gonna be rough.

05:18.040 --> 05:20.470
Whatever's on your mind, just ask.

05:22.690 --> 05:25.170
Um, well...

05:25.770 --> 05:28.970
There's this student named Usa Mimi I've been wondering about.

05:30.450 --> 05:33.220
She's been absent for the past month.

05:33.810 --> 05:36.230
Maybe she's being hospitalized, or maybe...

05:36.230 --> 05:38.230
She quit school.

05:38.670 --> 05:46.730
Actually, it may have been one of the events that led the former teacher, Nakamura-sensei, to quit.

05:46.730 --> 05:50.740
A lot of stuff seemed to trouble him.

05:51.330 --> 05:55.330
He would suddenly get into fits of rage or cry during class.

05:55.330 --> 05:59.890
He took unapproved absences and even got complaints from parents.

06:01.310 --> 06:06.170
He probably reached his breaking point as a teacher, I believe.

06:06.170 --> 06:09.130
Later, he called us saying that he wants to quit.

06:10.850 --> 06:14.170
However you put it, it's a delicate situation we have here.

06:12.640 --> 06:13.350
SENDING MAIL...

06:19.730 --> 06:22.230
Kojima Takaya

06:20.050 --> 06:22.230
Usa Mimi, huh?

06:26.850 --> 06:27.610
Oh?

06:31.660 --> 06:33.120
Nyaa?

06:33.870 --> 06:37.790
This cat got lost here around ten days ago.

06:38.550 --> 06:42.130
Since he was all skin and bones, I've been leaving him leftovers from my school lunch.

06:42.490 --> 06:47.130
Actually, this cat likes sweet rolls better than regular bread.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.990
Heh...

06:49.690 --> 06:51.390
Don't put him out.

06:51.390 --> 06:52.140
Huh?

06:52.140 --> 06:54.390
Grownups lie all the time.

06:54.390 --> 06:58.140
They hurt others without any remorse. And they do cruel stuff with no regret.

06:58.140 --> 06:59.750
Cruel stuff?

06:59.750 --> 07:04.190
They say we should care for animals, but then they go off and kill them.

07:05.270 --> 07:07.030
I would never do that.

07:08.410 --> 07:10.150
I like cats a lot.

07:10.650 --> 07:13.650
I have an old cat living with my parents.

07:13.650 --> 07:17.330
His name is Kotatsu. That's because he loves heated tables-

07:13.650 --> 07:17.610
*Heated table = kotatsu

07:20.710 --> 07:23.330
Sonuva-! He got me good.

07:24.410 --> 07:26.800
You're bleeding? I'll stop it for you.

07:37.110 --> 07:38.910
H... Her tongue's-

07:47.150 --> 07:49.820
Afternoon classes are about to start!

07:56.670 --> 07:59.160
She wanted to stop the bleeding, huh?

07:59.160 --> 08:02.750
But because of my quickened
pulse, it just bleeds even more.

08:05.890 --> 08:07.900
HOPE

08:06.330 --> 08:08.650
All right, take a good look at the example.

08:08.650 --> 08:10.380
Hey, you there, no running!

08:12.330 --> 08:14.500
Hey, that's too big!

08:15.010 --> 08:17.390
Kagami, let me see that.

08:17.390 --> 08:20.140
All right, you start from here.

08:20.670 --> 08:23.710
If you don't, your next stroke won't connect-

08:23.710 --> 08:25.270
Quit feeling me up, lolicon.

08:25.270 --> 08:26.310
Eh?

08:26.310 --> 08:28.290
Sensei! I'm done!

08:28.290 --> 08:29.040
Oh...

08:29.020 --> 08:29.780
INSIDE

08:29.780 --> 08:31.530
I HOPE YOU
CREAM
INSIDE ME

08:29.780 --> 08:31.530
KOKONOE RIN
CLASS 3-1

08:30.590 --> 08:31.530
Here!

08:31.530 --> 08:33.630
What the heck do you think you're writing?

08:33.630 --> 08:35.530
Why not?

08:35.530 --> 08:38.550
Just writing "hope" would be <i>soo boring!</i>

08:39.450 --> 08:44.500
So should I be <i>your brush's first ink?</i>

08:49.750 --> 08:53.150
No way! Aoki-sensei, you're really still a virgin?

08:57.250 --> 08:58.790
What are you doing, Sensei?

08:58.790 --> 09:00.710
S-Sorry!

09:00.710 --> 09:02.670
What's with the racket this time?!

09:02.670 --> 09:05.150
I-I'm deeply sorry!

09:16.310 --> 09:17.660
Sensei, bye-bye!

09:17.660 --> 09:19.610
Sensei, <i>boob</i>-bye!

09:19.610 --> 09:22.390
Hey! Just who are you saying "boob-bye" to?

09:23.770 --> 09:25.040
Aoki-sensei!

09:26.930 --> 09:28.430
Hard at work I see, Houin-sensei.

09:29.270 --> 09:32.680
Uh, can I have a moment of your time?

09:34.770 --> 09:37.770
This is the class textbook that Nakamura-sensei used.

09:38.430 --> 09:41.220
I found it while clearing out his things.

09:45.510 --> 09:51.480
I went to the principal about this, but he told me to keep quiet about it.

09:51.890 --> 09:55.830
He said that if this were to get out, it would just cause an uproar among the students.

09:57.450 --> 10:01.390
Are you sure... a student in my class did this?

10:01.390 --> 10:02.500
I wasn't sure what to do.

10:03.330 --> 10:06.050
But I don't want to keep this hidden.

10:07.810 --> 10:11.500
Aoki-sensei, I want you to deal with your students knowing everything.

10:26.830 --> 10:28.930
This is unbelievable.

10:28.930 --> 10:33.400
It's true that those kids are noisy, stuck-up and smart-alecky.

10:33.400 --> 10:33.820
DIE!

10:33.820 --> 10:34.230
YA STINK!

10:34.230 --> 10:34.650
YOU MAKE ME     PUKE!

10:34.650 --> 10:38.110
YOU'RE STILL BREATHING?

10:34.650 --> 10:38.110
SHIT

10:34.650 --> 10:38.110
SCUMBAG TEACHER

10:34.650 --> 10:38.110
DICK CHEESE

10:34.650 --> 10:38.110
QUIT ALREADY!

10:34.650 --> 10:38.110
TRASH!!!

10:35.330 --> 10:38.110
But, to go this far?

10:43.370 --> 10:46.620
Wh... What's up? Haven't gone home yet?

10:47.010 --> 10:47.630
"Die."

10:51.270 --> 10:56.350
"Ya stink... Don't come to school... Go to hell."

10:56.350 --> 10:58.570
K-Kokonoe!

10:58.570 --> 10:59.880
Wait, you did this?

11:01.190 --> 11:05.390
I only did the same things that Nakamura-sensei did.

11:05.390 --> 11:07.330
The same... things?

11:07.330 --> 11:11.190
Yep, the very same things he said to Mimi-chan.

11:11.870 --> 11:13.510
"Speak up!"

11:13.510 --> 11:15.070
"Quit whimpering!"

11:15.070 --> 11:15.810
"Retard!"

11:15.810 --> 11:17.170
"Quit crying so much!"

11:17.170 --> 11:19.160
"I get pissed off just looking at you!"

11:20.900 --> 11:23.570
"Why didja stop coming to school?" he said.

11:23.570 --> 11:25.160
It was all <i>your fault!</i>

11:26.650 --> 11:33.690
Just... Just because of that... you had to push him to the point of illness?

11:34.370 --> 11:36.190
So that's how it's gonna be, huh?

11:36.190 --> 11:37.070
Eh?

11:38.080 --> 11:42.430
A-Anyways, we need to discuss this with your parents-

11:46.850 --> 11:51.550
If I were to scream "Help me!" right here and now...

11:51.550 --> 11:54.650
Sensei, what do you think will happen?

11:57.600 --> 11:59.030
Rin-chan.

12:01.290 --> 12:02.450
You're late!

12:02.830 --> 12:04.790
I was getting tired of waiting.

12:08.810 --> 12:10.080
Virgin.

12:10.080 --> 12:14.390
Mimi-chan wasn't the only one victimized by Nakamura.

12:15.330 --> 12:18.090
Everybody's grateful for what Rin-chan did.

12:18.090 --> 12:25.140
If you ever reveal this to anyone, I'll do you like we did Nakamura.

12:26.470 --> 12:27.890
Kuro-chan!

12:27.890 --> 12:29.790
Ah, wait up!

12:35.570 --> 12:36.910
But it's a video.

12:36.910 --> 12:38.400
No videos either!

12:45.010 --> 12:49.670
Rin-chan, you must have some
sort of thing for Aoki-sensei.

12:49.670 --> 12:50.850
Not really.

12:50.850 --> 12:55.470
But you fellated his finger and gave him a free striptease. That's some servicing you're doing.

12:55.470 --> 12:56.500
Fellated?

12:57.090 --> 13:02.510
You don't know where that finger has been. It's unclean, you'll get cooties and become the class reject.

13:03.890 --> 13:06.470
I won't be doing it anymore.

13:07.170 --> 13:08.970
Rin-chan...

13:08.970 --> 13:12.720
Anyway, I won't let anybody hurt Mimi-chan.

13:13.090 --> 13:14.230
Ever.

13:24.610 --> 13:28.750
"Nyaa"...was it?

13:28.750 --> 13:32.200
Sorry about what happened earlier. Scared you, didn't I?

13:34.010 --> 13:34.710
Hmm?

13:36.410 --> 13:39.490
Grownups do cruel stuff with no regret.

13:45.910 --> 13:51.260
Ah, I apologize for you needing to come here. Honestly, that girl...

13:51.260 --> 13:52.610
Mimi!

13:52.610 --> 13:56.770
Uh, thanks. If it's all right with you, I like to speak with the child alone.

14:00.590 --> 14:04.410
H-Hi there! Um...

14:05.670 --> 14:08.990
I'm your new teacher, Aoki Daisuke.

14:09.610 --> 14:10.650
Nice to meet you.

14:12.490 --> 14:18.500
I've heard a lot. You're pretty smart aren't you? You've been getting all fives on your grades.

14:18.500 --> 14:20.500
Pretty neat!

14:19.710 --> 14:20.500
<i>Wrong move!</i>

14:21.750 --> 14:25.510
So what about it? Will you be coming back to school?

14:25.510 --> 14:29.510
Wrong! That was even worse!

14:34.070 --> 14:36.520
Kokonoe and Kagami told me everything.

14:37.290 --> 14:40.840
They said your old teacher said some pretty terrible things to you.

14:43.570 --> 14:45.270
So are you...

14:46.650 --> 14:48.280
...going to believe me?

14:51.790 --> 14:52.280
Mm-hmm.

15:00.150 --> 15:05.030
Grownups didn't get it. Not her teachers nor her parents.

15:05.030 --> 15:09.710
That's why she had no choice but to quit school in order to protect herself.

15:11.390 --> 15:12.800
It must have been hard on you.

15:20.790 --> 15:21.430
Really?

15:21.430 --> 15:22.990
Yeah!

15:24.310 --> 15:26.090
Welp, I really gotta-

15:26.750 --> 15:29.820
Um, can I ask you one more question?

15:29.820 --> 15:32.070
Uh, sure! Ask me anythi-

15:32.070 --> 15:34.070
What's "fellating a finger"?

15:35.490 --> 15:36.240
Here.

15:37.210 --> 15:39.030
It's ok for me to look?

15:39.030 --> 15:40.150
Uh-huh.

15:40.740 --> 15:43.270
KURO-CHAN

15:40.740 --> 15:43.270
FOLLOW-UP 2

15:40.740 --> 15:43.270
IT'S FUN MAKING FUN OF THE NEW GUY!

15:41.330 --> 15:44.030
Those are the text messages I've been getting from Rin-chan and Kuro-chan.

15:43.520 --> 15:44.770
TOTALLY UNREAL!

15:43.520 --> 15:44.770
RIN-CHAN FELLATED HIS FINGER!

15:44.030 --> 15:47.190
It looked like they've been having a lot of fun.

15:44.770 --> 15:46.020
WE'LL BE CHECKING UP ON HIM REAL GOOD

15:46.020 --> 15:47.520
IT'LL BE ALL RIGHT.

15:46.020 --> 15:47.520
HE DOESN'T SEEM LIKE A BAD GUY.

15:47.190 --> 15:53.260
That's why I kind of wanted to meet you, Aoki-sensei.

15:54.510 --> 15:56.110
I don't get it.

15:56.110 --> 16:01.030
Best friends that care for each other or people capable of savagely taking down adults...

16:01.030 --> 16:03.820
What exactly are they?

16:07.910 --> 16:08.770
But still...

16:16.410 --> 16:18.950
Man, they lost the ballgame yesterday.

16:18.950 --> 16:21.200
Huh, actually I didn't catch it.

16:21.200 --> 16:22.310
What the frick?

16:22.310 --> 16:23.730
Because it's <i>baseball?</i>

16:29.610 --> 16:31.150
Morning, Mimi-chan!

16:31.150 --> 16:31.840
Morning.

16:33.350 --> 16:37.950
Today we're doing experiments! Airguns!

16:38.650 --> 16:40.470
My sniping skills are gonna improve after this.

16:41.070 --> 16:43.030
Aren't you psyched, Mimi-chan?

16:58.120 --> 17:02.660
Making Air        Guns

16:58.810 --> 17:01.910
All right, I'll dispense with the details and just show you first off.

17:13.270 --> 17:16.470
<i>Children... aren't they great?</i>

17:20.210 --> 17:21.970
Nyaa, it's time to eat!

17:23.030 --> 17:24.350
Nyaa?

17:23.370 --> 17:25.230
Is he around here?

17:25.670 --> 17:26.430
A sweet roll?

17:26.430 --> 17:27.730
Nyaa?

17:27.730 --> 17:29.830
Nyaa?

17:28.250 --> 17:29.830
Who put it there?

17:29.830 --> 17:31.950
I guess he's not here.

17:34.350 --> 17:35.740
R-Rin-chan!

17:35.740 --> 17:37.740
Up... Up there!

17:40.970 --> 17:48.130
It doesn't seem right for me to pass judgment on events that happened before I was even here.

17:48.130 --> 17:53.610
But... on the other hand, if I do have to make a call, I would...

17:55.340 --> 17:57.190
Virgin!

17:57.190 --> 17:58.590
V-Virgin?

17:58.590 --> 18:00.130
You- what are you doin-

18:00.130 --> 18:02.390
Rin-chan's in serious trouble!

18:02.710 --> 18:04.390
Rin-chan!

18:04.770 --> 18:06.770
Come back down!

18:08.650 --> 18:09.710
Kokonoe!

18:09.710 --> 18:11.530
I'll get the ladder!

18:11.530 --> 18:13.200
Kokonoe, don't move!

18:14.170 --> 18:15.690
I have to save him.

18:16.750 --> 18:20.200
That poor little thing, abused by others.

18:20.690 --> 18:22.530
I have to save him.

18:23.070 --> 18:26.230
There are kind people too.

18:26.230 --> 18:27.310
Kokonoe...

18:30.150 --> 18:33.170
Come here, Nyaa. It's all right.

18:36.420 --> 18:38.310
Kokonoe!

18:47.550 --> 18:48.870
Rin-chan!

18:49.810 --> 18:53.390
Rin-chan!  I'll get a teacher!

18:51.190 --> 18:53.390
Aoki-sensei?

19:02.270 --> 19:04.010
No Sensei! Don't die!

19:04.010 --> 19:06.200
Rin-chan, you shouldn't move him.

19:04.610 --> 19:06.200
Sensei! Sensei!

19:06.710 --> 19:09.990
Sensei!!

19:09.990 --> 19:11.250
Kokonoe...

19:13.730 --> 19:16.630
That girl looks just like a cat.

19:18.530 --> 19:22.470
There are bells on her, and she has two tails.

19:23.690 --> 19:27.770
"That poor thing, abused by others."

19:27.770 --> 19:33.150
"I have to save him. There are kind people too."

19:34.350 --> 19:37.710
Oh. So that's what it was?

19:37.710 --> 19:42.910
It wasn't just Mimi or Nyaa who
became so distrustful of people.

19:46.050 --> 19:48.110
They said he was only knocked out.

19:48.110 --> 19:50.370
Nothing to get worried about, thank goodness.

19:50.370 --> 19:51.410
Yeah.

19:51.830 --> 19:57.090
Aoki-sensei, you know, said he believed me.

19:57.090 --> 19:59.930
It was just like how you texted me.

20:00.610 --> 20:03.290
"It will be all right with Aoki-sensei."

20:04.190 --> 20:05.390
Mimi-chan...

20:07.610 --> 20:10.870
Houin-sensei says to hurry back to class.

20:10.870 --> 20:12.940
She'll look after him later.

20:12.940 --> 20:14.630
All right!

20:21.440 --> 20:24.550
Thank you, Sensei.

20:38.410 --> 20:41.260
Ah, you've come to?

20:42.330 --> 20:45.010
Really, I'm sorry for causing such a fuss.

20:45.010 --> 20:46.450
Don't sweat it.

20:47.630 --> 20:50.010
I'm actually glad it was you I took care of.

20:50.010 --> 20:51.070
Huh?

20:51.070 --> 20:56.150
Oh yeah! Do you want to have dinner on the way back? It will be my treat.

20:57.310 --> 20:58.470
You'll do that for me?

20:58.470 --> 21:00.290
I'll get my things!

21:01.650 --> 21:03.780
Sensei!

21:04.710 --> 21:06.650
This is our thanks for saving me!

21:06.650 --> 21:07.200
Eh?

21:07.710 --> 21:10.350
Uh... do we have to do it too?

21:10.350 --> 21:11.370
Hey, come on!

21:11.370 --> 21:13.710
I'm not feeling any better about this.

21:16.290 --> 21:18.710
Hey! You guys-!

21:17.290 --> 21:18.710
Ready... set ...

21:18.710 --> 21:19.790
Go!

21:23.430 --> 21:27.470
That was probably too hot for the virgin to handle.

21:28.720 --> 21:30.470
Don't say that!

21:31.930 --> 21:34.370
Kokonoe!

21:37.090 --> 21:38.480
Sorry to keep you waiting!

21:42.810 --> 21:44.960
H... Huh?

21:47.740 --> 21:49.820
I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

21:49.820 --> 21:52.400
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

21:52.400 --> 21:54.830
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly

21:54.830 --> 21:56.450
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

22:02.830 --> 22:05.400
Geh! No way! I'm not waiting ten years to LOVE LOVE!

22:05.400 --> 22:07.950
