22:18.100 --> 22:19.950
A HEART BEAT that is so loud.

22:19.950 --> 22:22.840
That's just how I do things, baby.

22:23.170 --> 22:28.440
Convey your feelings for me

22:28.440 --> 22:33.040
not with words, but through warm kisses.

22:33.040 --> 22:37.200
Let's turn our entire world

22:37.200 --> 22:43.170
upside down, right now.

22:43.890 --> 22:46.030
A girl's punch will get through, don't you think?

22:46.030 --> 22:48.640
Will the surprise be enough to attract you?

22:48.640 --> 22:51.100
A thought-over impulse is also great

22:51.100 --> 22:53.680
LUCKY I gobbled down your earlobe.

22:53.680 --> 22:56.170
Kiss! I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

22:56.170 --> 22:58.710
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

22:58.710 --> 23:01.180
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly.

23:01.180 --> 23:02.680
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

23:06.600 --> 23:11.370
Baby, I want you, ahhhh

23:14.990 --> 23:26.960
NEXT EPISODE

23:16.540 --> 23:20.120
Aoki-sensei, you look like you're a little lost.

23:20.120 --> 23:23.210
Don't worry, I have complete confidence in you.

23:23.210 --> 23:27.150
I'm sure you'll get real big, Sensei.

23:27.000 --> 23:29.990
A SMILING REWARD

23:27.000 --> 23:29.990
2nd PERIOD

23:27.150 --> 23:29.970
Really, really, really big.

23:29.970 --> 23:40.980
SEE YOU NEXT VOLUME! (^_^)
